# "Enchant creature you control": Bot2's Ornithopter is refused as the Aura's target (the refusal), Bot1's Llanowar Elves are not (the
# positive control). Hexproof stops only opposing players' spells and abilities (CR 702.11b): the turn the Aura enters, Bot1's own
# Battlefield Improvisation can still target the hexproof Elves, which end the turn a 4/4 (1/1, +1/+1 from the Aura, +2/+2).

